cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Visual Realism Does Not Predict Seed-Quality Utility in AI-Generated
  Synthetic Seeds
message: >-
  If you use this code or its results, please cite the paper using the
  metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Bhanu Prakash
    family-names: Vangala
