  - given-names: Navya
    family-names: Vangala
    affiliation: Amar Biotech Private Limited
abstract: >-
  Eight generator configurations (pixel and latent diffusion, GANs) trained on
  a five-class soybean seed-quality corpus, with the same fixed synthetic
  images evaluated for distributional realism (FID and related metrics),
  near-copying, real-versus-synthetic separability, utility on held-out real
  seeds, finite-sample FID, sampler stability and computational cost.
keywords:
  - synthetic seeds
  - generative artificial intelligence
  - soybean seed quality
  - synthetic data validation
  - FID
  - seed imaging
